# Mobile build outputs — keep them out of every Docker build context.
# The android tree alone is ~1.5 GB after a cancun gradle build is pulled
# back to macmini for apksigner re-sign; tarring it into the context blew
# past Docker's VM disk quota (ENOSPC) during server + webapp builds on
# 2026-06-09. None of the server/webapp/cli images need any of this.
**/android/app/build
**/android/build
**/android/.gradle
**/android/app/release
**/android/local.properties
**/ios/build
**/ios/DerivedData
